From: Wenjie Qi <qwjhust@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] f2fs: flush SIT journal during filesystem resize

Upstream: a6ede405455106bf42164ec96fd84008c5aabdd9
Apply to the UMI Android kernel at 73a8cedfee02256cb19a7974f0beadf95c580048.

diff --git a/fs/f2fs/segment.c b/fs/f2fs/segment.c
--- a/fs/f2fs/segment.c
+++ b/fs/f2fs/segment.c
@@ -4097,7 +4097,7 @@
 
 	down_write(&sit_i->sentry_lock);
 
-	if (!sit_i->dirty_sentries)
+	if (!sit_i->dirty_sentries && to_journal)
 		goto out;
 
 	/*
